        <h2 class="et-h2 et-italic">Why I started</h2>
        <div class="et-mt-lg" style="display:grid;gap:1.25rem;line-height:1.85;opacity:.88;max-width:36rem">
          <p>Earth &amp; Tonic started during my own health journey after being diagnosed with PCOS. I wanted to better understand my body, so I began researching herbs and natural ingredients to support my overall wellness. What started as a personal passion quickly turned into something I genuinely loved.</p>
